# T6. The arm's 12 V drops for 300 ms while it holds at the skill's start (no stop-sense edge). Its servos reboot
# with torque off and their limits reset; after the clear the re-read shows torque off. A replay is then refused
# torque_off before anyone is asked to press Confirm, and no torque comes on, until torque is turned on again
# from the terminal with Confirm.
expect motion mode ready
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key pose-ready-left
wait 2100
key c
expect 5000 motion command arm.go_to_pose completed operator_cli
key power-cycle-left
expect motion fault feedback_stale arm_left
expect sim left follower power back
wait 300
key operator-clear
wait 2100
key c
expect motion cleared all faults
expect motion torque left follower off (re-read)
key skill-run-sample
expect motion command skill.run refused:torque_off operator_cli
absent 1000 sim torque-on
absent 10 motion target skill.run
key torque-on-left
wait 2100
key c
expect motion torque left on
key skill-run-sample
expect motion target skill.run operator_cli: SIMULATED sample: hold it out
key q
